    "description": "245th CAOS is an expeditionary unit organized to rapidly deploy, establish, operate, and sustain combat airfield operations in austere, forward-deployed, contingency, or Agile Combat Employment (ACE) environments. The squadron integrates deployable Air Traffic Control (ATC), Airfield Management (AM), and Radar, Airfield, and Weather Systems (RAWS) maintenance to provide safe, expeditionary command-and-control of aircraft and airfield infrastructure.",
